# VINCE project skills

Agent playbooks live at `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (same files as `skills/<name>/SKILL.md`).

When the task matches a domain, open and follow the matching skill before improvising:

| Skill folder | Domain |
|--------------|--------|
| `vince` | Paper bot, ALOHA, signals, perps/options context, handoffs — no execution |
| `solus` | Hypersurface, strikes, wheel, assignment calibration, stock theses |
| `otaku` | Funded wallet, swap/bridge/DCA/Morpho/stops, execution safety |
| `kelly` | Lifestyle, hotels/dining/wine/fitness, orchestration — no Kelly-owned market calls |
| `forge` | Nightly policy/prompt experiments, FORGE_* env |
| `echo` | CT sentiment, WTT |
| `eliza` | Knowledge ingest, UPLOAD, corpus-first answers |
| `sentinel` | PRDs, OpenClaw, cost, architecture |
| `clawterm` | OpenClaw terminal / setup |
| `naval` | Philosophy, no trading |
| `quant` | Prediction markets, MC, Brier, copulas |
| `x-research` | X/Twitter search CLI and research flow |
| `trading-agent` | External EVClaw / live HL reference |
| `whats-the-trade` | WTT / belief-router |

Registry: `skills/registry.json`. Index: `skills/README.md`.
